### ================================================================
### Movie Ticket Booking System — REST API Test Suite
### Can be executed with VS Code REST Client extension or curl
### ================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Get All Movies (with search and genre filtering)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?search=Dune

### 3. Get All Genres
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/genres/all

### 4. Get Single Movie Details with Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/1

### 5. Get Shows for a Movie
GET {{baseUrl}}/shows?movie_id=1

### 6. Get Live Seat Map for Show #1 (includes is_booked flag)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shows/1/seats

### 7. Book Tickets (Call Stored Procedure with Row Locking)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 3,
  "show_id": 1,
  "seat_ids": [19, 20],
  "payment_method": "upi"
}

### 8. Attempt Double Booking of SAME Seats (Expect 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 4,
  "show_id": 1,
  "seat_ids": [19],
  "payment_method": "credit_card"
}

### 9. Get User Booking History
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/user/3

### 10. Cancel a Booking (Frees Seats & Fires Audit Trigger)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1

### 11. View Movie Revenue Leaderboard (Database View v_movie_revenue)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/movie-revenue

### 12. View Live Show Seat Availability (Database View v_show_availability)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/show-availability

### 13. View Busiest Theatres (GROUP BY + HAVING)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/busiest-theatres?minBookings=2

### 14. View Above-Average Rated Movies (Scalar Subquery)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/top-rated-movies

### 15. View Cancellation Audit Logs (audit_log table)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/audit-logs

### 16. Add a Review
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 4,
  "movie_id": 1,
  "rating": 5,
  "review_text": "Mind-blowing cinema experience!"
}
